# Docker-provisioned feeder datasets. ~14 MB of upstream IEEE test-case data
# fetched into the image at build time, never committed -- CI checkouts do not
# have them, which is why tests must load examples/IEEE37Bus_PV.dss instead.
# Ignored because they are DATA, not code: left untracked they surface as `??`
# in `git status`, and the parent's SLURM clean-tree guard
# (scripts/local-slurm/_require_clean_tree.sh, Redmine #1254) watches
# `dockerfiles` as a result path -- so every job submission on a machine that
# has run the stack was refused for a tree that was not actually dirty.
examples/ieee123/
examples/ieee8500/
